    # mc "I know it's a bit of a weird rule, but it is what it is. I've got a job to do, and that means I may occasionally have to check you're following this rule with spot inspections."
    mc "我知道这规矩有点怪，但既然定了就是这样。我有工作要做，也就是说，偶尔得突击检查你们有没有遵守。"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:2751
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_a697d6ff:

    # mc "Hopefully I'm never given a reason to actually have to do it, but I figured I should give you the heads up that I am technically required to do so when necessary."
    mc "希望我永远不会被逼着真去做，但按规矩，必要时我确实有权这么做，还是先跟你们说一声。"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:2754
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_0232113d:

    # mc "{b}{u}Rule Three:{/u}{/b}\n Relationships."
    mc "{b}{u}规则变化三：{/u}{/b}\n关系。"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:2772
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_b0b649b6:

    # mc "Relationships could distract you from your studies, and therefore are not permitted. If you believe that there is a compelling reason that you won't be distracted by such things, we can set up an interview and discuss."
    mc "恋爱关系可能会分散你们的学业注意力，因此不被允许。当然，如果你们觉得自己有充分的理由保证不会分心，我们可以安排一次面谈再谈。"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:2773
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_7a8c6a30:

    # mc "If after the interview I feel there is merit to your claims, then I may amend your personal contract to allow your relationship."
    mc "如果面谈之后我觉得你们说得有道理，我可能会修改个人合同，允许你们交往。"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:2774
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_6f7e5f8e:

    # mc "Feel free to come to my office and discuss further if this rule change applies to you."
    mc "如果这条改动影响到你，欢迎来我办公室细谈。"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:2776
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_e6b3641c:

    # mc "And now, for the final rule..."
    mc "接下来，最后一条规则……"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:2777
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_84fd2232:

    # mc "I am within my rights to write more rules as I see fit. But for now, this is the last rule you must abide by."
    mc "我有权按照自己的判断追加更多规则。不过目前，这是你们必须遵守的最后一条。"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:2780
