    mc "奖励首要的一点，应该是{i}你{/i}想要的。"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3293
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_6b697f95:

    # belle "What if we don't intend on being punished, therefore can we never get a reward?"
    belle "如果我们压根不打算受罚，那是不是永远都拿不到奖励？"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3295
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_565fbf05:

    # belle "Are you saying that in order to get a reward, we must be punished beforehand?"
    belle "你是说，想拿奖励，就必须先挨罚？"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3298
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_d1425716:

    # belle "That sounds like one hell of a juxtaposition, [school_player_name]..."
    belle "听起来可真够天差地别的，[school_player_name]……"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3300
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_83742a06:

    # mc "It would, but you didn't let me finish."
    mc "确实，不过你还没让我把话说完。"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3302
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_9da64352:

    # mc "You're right that a reward {i}can{/i} be given to end a punishment."
