# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3303
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_ce52c646:

    # mc "But a reward can also be given without that, in the same capacity."
    mc "但奖励也可以和那种情况无关，照样发放。"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3305
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_71da4421:

    # mc "Let's do something fun, and drive competition, shall we?"
    mc "那我们搞点有趣的，顺便也刺激一下竞争，怎么样？"

