# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3418
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_0d8836cc:

    # mc "Of course, have a think about what has just been talked about, and review your contracts. If there is anything else you need, please come to my office and we can work something out."
    mc "当然，回去好好想想刚才讲的内容，也把合同再看一遍。还有别的需要，就来我办公室，我们一起想办法。"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3419
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_2782bb38:

    # mc "Thank you for being patient with me and asking questions. I expect you all to be model students, and we can have some fun and learn together."
    mc "谢谢你们的耐心和提问。我期待你们都成为模范学生——我们完全可以边玩边学。"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3420
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_ed56aa0a:

    # mc "You are dismissed."
    mc "解散！"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3425
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_e5953e1d:

    # mc "Hoookay. That was a long one, wasn't it?"
    mc "好——了。这一场可真够长的，对吧？"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3426
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_7a003156:

    # mc "I'm sure you all have a bunch of questions you're not comfortable asking in a public setting like this. So, if you do, please come to my office at some point and we can talk through it."
    mc "我知道你们肯定有些问题，在这种场合不方便问。如果确实有，改天来我办公室，我们好好聊聊。"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3427
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_c6f632b8:

    # mc "We all must follow the PARE system. It is what it is."
    mc "所有人都必须遵守赏罚系统。就是这样。"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3428
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_015255a2:

    # mc "So, behave yourselves, and go get some lunch and then carry on with your studies."
    mc "所以都给我乖点，去吃午饭，然后回来接着上课。"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3429
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_fcca757d:

    # mc "You're free to leave."
    mc "你们可以走了。"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3436
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_8c2557c5:

    # "The students get up one by one and head out to the canteen, speaking amongst themselves."
    "学生们三三两两地起身，一边走一边聊，朝食堂去了。"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3440
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_533c2671:

    # mc "Oh, [nova]!"
    mc "哦，[nova]！"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3442
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_a32ba952:

    # nova "Y-yes, Sensei?"
    nova "是、是的，老师？"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3444
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_26d07190:

    # mc "After lunch, come to my office. There is something I need to speak to you about."
    mc "午饭后到我办公室来一趟，我有话要跟你说。"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3446
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_876308b4:

    # suz "Yeah, [nova]. Go see [school_player_name] after lunch!"
    suz "没错，[nova]。午饭后去找[school_player_name]！"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3448
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_c4e2f3ce:

    # nova "..."
    nova "……"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3450
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_10452bd4:

    # nova "Yes Sensei."
    nova "好的，老师。"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3452
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_e3f97ab8:

    # mc "With that out of the way, let's talk to the staff quickly."
    mc "这件事说完了，我简单跟各位教职员交代几句。"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3455
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_5eaa3130:

    # mcT "I wonder how Mrs. J is recovering... Heh."
    mcT "不知道杰克逊女士恢复得怎么样了……嘿嘿。"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3457
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_b9ab7396:

    # "You gesture to [clarissa] to come stand next to you."
    "你示意[clarissa]过来站在你旁边。"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3460
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_4ee2c4a8:

    # mc "Mornin' T-"
    mc "早上好，T——"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3461
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_b170054c:

    # mc "...Where's [nurse]?"
    mc "……[nurse]在哪里？"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3463
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_67c7ec23:

    # clarissa "She... said she was going to do something, and asked me for my favorite color..." id D5_Principal_3_67c7ec23
