translate chinese D5_Principal_3_85fc31e5:

    # mcT "Oh [clarissa]... I don't think you're one to talk about strange when you pour a salt ring around yourself..."
    mcT "哦，[clarissa]……你自己都在脚边撒了一圈盐，还好意思说别人奇怪……"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3469
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_9d405a73:

    # mc "Unfortunately, yes... I'm sure it'll only get worse, try not to provoke the horny bear." id D5_Principal_3_9d405a73
    mc "很不幸，是的……我敢肯定只会越来越糟。别去招惹那只发情的熊。" id D5_Principal_3_9d405a73

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3472
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_4372a1a2:

    # clarissa "...Okay..?"
    clarissa "……好吧……？"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3474
