    # mc "{size=-7}*Coughs*{/size} Anyway, mornin' team. This is [clarissa]. She is my new assistant to help with my duties around here."
    mc "{size=-7}*咳嗽*{/size}总之，各位早上好。这位是[clarissa]，我的新助理，帮我处理这边的日常事务。"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3477
