    # mc "The salt...will be corrected. Sorry if you thought she was a little strange."
    mc "撒盐的事……会改的。如果你们觉得她有点奇怪，我先道歉。"

# game/Days/dayFive.rpy:3481
translate chinese D5_Principal_3_a983c007:

